            { qNum: 187, q: "What was the daily rental rate for the Boom Lift?", opts: [{ key: "A", text: "$300." }, { key: "B", text: "$380." }, { key: "C", text: "$500." }, { key: "D", text: "$450." }], a: "D", exp: "🎯 **Đáp án đúng: D** ($450.)\\n\\n🔍 **Dẫn chứng:** '50-Foot Diesel Boom Lift (Model BL-500) — Rate: $450/day'\\n\\n💡 **Từ vựng then chốt:**\\n- `daily rental rate` (giá thuê theo ngày)" },
            { qNum: 188, q: "Why was a $120 deduction taken from the security deposit?", opts: [{ key: "A", text: "The mini excavator was returned with a half-empty fuel tank requiring 15 gallons." }, { key: "B", text: "The boom lift sustained scratches on the paint." }, { key: "C", text: "The equipment was returned two hours late." }, { key: "D", text: "A key replacement fee was assessed." }], a: "A", exp: "🎯 **Đáp án đúng: A** (The mini excavator was returned with a half-empty fuel tank requiring 15 gallons.)\\n\\n🔍 **Dẫn chứng:** Doc 2: 'Mini Excavator (EX-50)... Fuel Tank: 50% FULL (Requires 15 gallons diesel fuel to fill) @ $8.00/gal = $120.00'\\n\\n💡 **Từ vựng then chốt:**\\n- `security deposit deduction` (khấu trừ tiền đặt cọc bảo đảm)" },
            { qNum: 189, q: "How much net deposit refund was credited back to Horizon Builders?", opts: [{ key: "A", text: "$650.00." }, { key: "B", text: "$880.00." }, { key: "C", text: "$1,000.00." }, { key: "D", text: "$4,450.00." }], a: "B", exp: "🎯 **Đáp án đúng: B** ($880.00.)\\n\\n🔍 **Dẫn chứng:** Doc 2 & 3: 'Net Security Deposit Refund: $1,000.00 - $120.00 = $880.00 refunded'\\n\\n💡 **Từ vựng then chốt:**\\n- `net refund` (số tiền hoàn trả thực tế sau khi trừ chi phí)" },
            { qNum: 190, q: "Who inspected the returned machines at the rental yard?", opts: [{ key: "A", text: "Thomas Wright." }, { key: "B", text: "Laura Perez." }, { key: "C", text: "Carlos Mendez, Yard Supervisor." }, { key: "D", text: "The delivery truck driver." }], a: "C", exp: "🎯 **Đáp án đúng: C** (Carlos Mendez, Yard Supervisor.)\\n\\n🔍 **Dẫn chứng:** Doc 2: 'Inspector: Carlos Mendez (Metro Yard Supervisor)'\\n\\n💡 **Từ vựng then chốt:**\\n- `yard supervisor` (giám sát bãi máy móc thiết bị)" }
